576
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:26,000
Yani in sha allah ba'd shi sbou'en tlata...
 
Yes, God willing, in about two or three weeks...

577
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:30,000
In sha allah... ish shu... fina tfarjina hek yani shu ajza'
