God willing... what is... can you show us the items of your
trousseau?

578
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:32,000
Tfaddal... sharref...
 
Please... honor us...

579
00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:38,000
Sharrefi... linshuf ish bitjahhzi hon...
 
Please... let's see what you're preparing here...

580
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:40,000
Alf mabruk...
 
A thousand congratulations...

581
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:41,000
Allah ybarik fik.
 
May God bless you.

582
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:46,000
Hati linshuf ihkili 'an ajza' il-jihaz taba'ik... hayy w
hayy... w hayy... w hayy...
 
Come on, let's see, tell me about the parts of your
