583
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:49,000
hon hon... il-'ade il-'arus btishtiri willa l-'aris?
 
here and here... usually does the bride buy, or the groom?

584
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:55,000
L-'ade il-'arus w 'aris... yani nehna illna nehna mnishtiri
