588
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,000
Hadol hadaya hunne?
 
Are these gifts?

589
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:07,000
Eh ma sha allah mkattrin ya hajje mkattrin...
 
Yes, mashallah, they brought a lot, Hajja, they brought a
