591
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:16,000
Ihkili ish shu jihazuk, hati inshuf...
 
Tell me what your trousseau is, let's see...

592
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:24,000
Hadol luhaf... furushat... battaniyat... ihramat...
mkhaddat...
 
These are quilts... mattresses... blankets... covers...
pillows...

593
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:28,000
makinat il-kibbe, khallata, sharashif, hek shi...
 
a kibbeh machine, a blender, bedsheets, things like that...

594
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:33,000
w killun fi ballurat hek shighlat... hatetun bil-karatin...
