and they all have glassware and such things... I put them in
boxes... and packed them...

595
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:35,000
Hilu... w hadol t-tawlat...
 
Nice... and these tables...

596
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:40,000
Tawlat krasy... tikkayat... shantayat safar... kil shi...
 
Tables, chairs... cushions... travel bags... everything...

597
